<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Alliance of the Eclipse</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
}

body{
    min-height:100vh;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at center,
    #1b1035 0%,
    #090712 40%,
    #000000 100%);
    color:white;
}

/* ===== ЗВЁЗДЫ ===== */

.stars{
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    pointer-events:none;
}

.stars-small{
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,.9) 1px, transparent 2px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 25% 70%, rgba(255,255,255,.8) 1px, transparent 2px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, rgba(255,255,255,.9) 1px, transparent 2px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%, rgba(255,255,255,.8) 1px, transparent 2px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 95% 80%, rgba(255,255,255,.9) 1px, transparent 2px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 65% 90%, rgba(255,255,255,.7) 1px, transparent 2px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 90%, rgba(255,255,255,.9) 1px, transparent 2px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 75% 55%, rgba(255,255,255,.8) 1px, transparent 2px);
    animation:twinkle1 5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}

.stars-medium{
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 40%, rgba(220,220,255,1) 2px, transparent 4px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 40% 80%, rgba(255,255,255,1) 2px, transparent 4px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 70% 15%, rgba(220,220,255,1) 2px, transparent 4px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 65%, rgba(255,255,255,1) 2px, transparent 4px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 60% 45%, rgba(220,220,255,1) 2px, transparent 4px);
    animation:twinkle2 7s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}

.stars-large{
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, rgba(255,255,255,1) 4px, transparent 6px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 60% 55%, rgba(220,220,255,1) 4px, transparent 6px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,1) 5px, transparent 8px),
        radial-gradient(circle at 12% 55%, rgba(255,255,255,1) 4px, transparent 6px);
    filter:blur(.5px);
    animation:twinkle3 4s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes twinkle1{
    0%{opacity:.35;}
    50%{opacity:.8;}
    100%{opacity:.45;}
}

@keyframes twinkle2{
    0%{opacity:.4;}
    50%{opacity:1;}
    100%{opacity:.6;}
}

@keyframes twinkle3{
    0%{
        opacity:.5;
        transform:scale(1);
    }
    100%{
        opacity:1;
        transform:scale(1.05);
    }
}

/* ===== ОСНОВНОЙ КОНТЕНТ ===== */

.container{
    position:relative;
    z-index:10;
    height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
}

.logo{
    font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,5rem);
    font-weight:900;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:6px;
    text-shadow:
        0 0 15px #8a2be2,
        0 0 35px #8a2be2,
        0 0 60px #4a00ff;
}

.subtitle{
    margin-top:15px;
    font-size:1.3rem;
    color:#cfc3ff;
    max-width:700px;
}

/* ===== ЗАТМЕНИЕ ===== */

.eclipse{
    width:220px;
    height:220px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:black;
    position:relative;
    margin:40px 0;

    box-shadow:
        0 0 40px #7d3cff,
        0 0 80px #4a00ff,
        0 0 120px #25005a;

    animation:eclipseGlow 6s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.eclipse::before{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    inset:-12px;
    border-radius:50%;
    border:3px solid rgba(145,90,255,.5);
}

@keyframes eclipseGlow{
    0%,100%{
        box-shadow:
            0 0 40px #7d3cff,
            0 0 80px #4a00ff,
            0 0 120px #25005a;
    }

    50%{
        box-shadow:
            0 0 60px #9d6bff,
            0 0 120px #6f42ff,
            0 0 180px #3d008f;
    }
}

/* ===== КНОПКА ===== */

.join-btn{
    padding:18px 42px;
    border:none;
    border-radius:50px;
    cursor:pointer;

    font-size:1.2rem;
    font-weight:700;
    color:white;

    background:linear-gradient(
        45deg,
        #6f00ff,
        #9f5cff
    );

    box-shadow:0 0 25px #7d3cff;

    transition:.3s;
}

.join-btn:hover{
    transform:translateY(-3px) scale(1.05);

    box-shadow:
        0 0 20px #9f5cff,
        0 0 40px #9f5cff,
        0 0 80px #6f00ff;
}

.footer{
    margin-top:25px;
    color:#888;
    font-size:.9rem;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="stars stars-small"></div>
<div class="stars stars-medium"></div>
<div class="stars stars-large"></div>

<div class="container">

    <h1 class="logo">
        Alliance of the Eclipse
    </h1>

    <p class="subtitle">
        Во тьме космоса рождается новая сила.
        Присоединяйся к Альянсу и стань частью легенды.
    </p>

    <div class="eclipse"></div>

    <button
        class="join-btn"
        onclick="window.open('https://discord.gg/eDNTK7cHpJ','_blank')">
        Присоединиться в Альянс
    </button>

    <div class="footer">
        Alliance of the Eclipse © 2026
    </div>

</div>

</body>
  </html>
